# BREW Data Processing Utility - Parser Module

This module handles data ingestion and parsing from input files.

### Supported Formats
- CSV (Comma Separated Values)

### Functionality
- Reads input files
- Parses data into structured records
- Handles basic error detection during parsing

### Usage
Included in the main pipeline. Can be used standalone for parsing.

### Example
```brev
import parser;

data = parser.parse_csv("input.csv");
for each record in data {
    print(record);
}
```
